      47.85,
      372.25,
      539.93,
      430.48
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me, under Section 2 of the Urban Development Projects (Special Provisions) Act, No.02 of 1980, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka upon the recommendationof the Minister-in-charge of the subject of Urban Development, being of the opinion that the land specified in the Schedulehereto is urgently required for the purpose of the construction of a hostel for the University of Sri Jayawardenapura do bythis Order, declare that the said land is required for such purpose.",
